<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6571" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναθρῴσκω</span></b> , poet. and 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθρ-</span></b> : aor. 2
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θορεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			: aor. 1
			subj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναθρώξωσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.293
				</span></i>
			:—<i>spring up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕψι δ᾽ ἀναθρῴσκων πέτεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.140
				</span></i>
			; of blood, <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				100.8
			</span></i>; of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃς δ᾽ ἀμβώσας μέγα ἀναθρῴσκει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.774
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Glauc.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναθρῴσκει ἐπὶ τὸν ἵππον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.64
				</span></i>
			.</div>
